esofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-calls-cuba-a-failed-state-delegation-walks-out/articleshow/134415385.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T20:44:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134415451,imgsize-63226.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[67-year-old teacher moves to Delaware to care for grandchild]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134414644.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Rising childcare expenses are forcing many American parents to seek help from grandparents. Mary Jo Galusha retired early to care for her grandchildren in Delaware. This trend highlights a significant gap in the nation's childcare infrastructure. Grandparents often provide flexible and much-needed support for working families. Many grandparents willingly help their children and enjoy spending time with grandchildren.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/idaho-teacher-67-retires-and-moves-to-delaware-to-care-for-her-granddaughter-after-childcare-costs-matched-the-mortgage-now-she-spends-30-hours-a-week-caring-for-the-baby-as-us-childcare-costs-soar/articleshow/134414644.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/idaho-teacher-67-retires-and-moves-to-delaware-to-care-for-her-granddaughter-after-childcare-costs-matched-the-mortgage-now-she-spends-30-hours-a-week-caring-for-the-baby-as-us-childcare-costs-soar/articleshow/134414644.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T19:57:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134414725,imgsize-466464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1995, former NYSE CEO John Thain bought a Westchester estate for $3.7 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134413543.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[John Thain's sprawling estate in Westchester encompasses 10 beautiful acres, marked by its presence in three different towns. This magnificent 1910 mansion, which he bought in 1995, offers generous outdoor space and luxurious features. Thain, who previously headed NYSE and Merrill Lynch during the 2008 financial turmoil, successfully navigated CIT Group's restructuring before stepping back from the corporate scene. Today, he devotes his time to board memberships and environmental conservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1995-former-nyse-ceo-john-thain-bought-a-westchester-estate-for-3-7-million-the-roughly-10-acre-property-carries-five-addresses-and-stretches-across-three-new-york-municipalities/articleshow/134413543.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1995-former-nyse-ceo-john-thain-bought-a-westchester-estate-for-3-7-million-the-roughly-10-acre-property-carries-five-addresses-and-stretches-across-three-new-york-municipalities/articleshow/134413543.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T19:58:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134414756,imgsize-552498.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Xi-Trump summit: China puts Taiwan ‘red line’ at centre of US ties]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134415127.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[China firmly asserts that Taiwan remains a crucial boundary in its diplomatic ties with the United States. As President Xi Jinping arrives in Washington for a pivotal summit with President Donald Trump, key topics of discussion will include escalating tensions regarding Taiwan, trade agreements, and security matters. Additionally, China is implementing stricter regulations on chemicals involved in fentanyl production.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/xi-trump-summit-china-puts-taiwan-red-line-at-centre-of-us-ties/articleshow/134415127.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/xi-trump-summit-china-puts-taiwan-red-line-at-centre-of-us-ties/articleshow/134415127.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T20:26:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134415166,imgsize-67894.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sri Lanka court convicts 15 men over 2019 Easter Sunday bombings]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134414563.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Sri Lankan court found fifteen men guilty for their roles in the 2019 Easter bombings. These coordinated attacks tragically killed over two hundred sixty people across the island nation. Prosecutors stated one convicted man masterminded the devastating suicide bombings which targeted churches and hotels. Authorities filed over twenty-three thousand charges against twenty-four suspects in this significant legal proceeding.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/sri-lanka-court-convicts-15-men-over-2019-easter-sunday-bombings/articleshow/134414563.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/sri-lanka-court-convicts-15-men-over-2019-easter-sunday-bombings/articleshow/134414563.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T19:58:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-